<BaseLayout
  title="Speaking | Ayush Prakash"
  description="Three talks, adapted to length and audience."
  ogImage="/img/mtl-3.jpg"
>
  <div class="hero"><h1 class="dsub">Speaking</h1><p class="lede">Three talks, adapted to length and audience.</p></div>
  <div class="banner"><img src="/img/mtl-3.jpg" alt="" /></div>
  <hr class="rule" />
  <div class="talk"><h3>The First AI-Native Generation</h3><p>What sustained interaction with person-like AI does to development. The core research programme, presented as evidence and open questions rather than conclusions.</p></div>
  <div class="talk"><h3>Developmentally Responsible AI</h3><p>A framework for building systems that young people grow up inside. Practical, aimed at builders and regulators rather than ethicists.</p></div>
  <div class="talk"><h3>Digital Minds, Human Attribution, and Public Trust</h3><p>Why people believe machines have minds, what that belief does to institutions, and what follows for policy.</p></div>
  <div style="padding-top:clamp(44px,6vw,72px);border-top:1px solid var(--hair);margin-top:38px">
