    <div class="prose">
      <p>Ayush Prakash is Chief of Staff at New Sapience and host of the Ayush Prakash Podcast. He writes on AI and human development, and is based in Montreal. English and French.</p>
      <p><a href="#" style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink);text-decoration:none;padding-bottom:2px;cursor:pointer">Enquire</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
